      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "<b>CUANDO NADIE MIRA</b>\nMuseo interactivo de mitos y leyendas de Colombia\n\n<b>Equipo</b>\n[Nombre]\n[Nombre]\n[Nombre]\n[Nombre]\n\n<b>Curso</b>\n[Curso]\n\n<b>Universidad</b>\n[Universidad]\n\n<b>Fuentes
    tipogr\xE1ficas</b> (SIL Open Font License)\nIM Fell English \xB7 Igino Marini\nCormorant
    Garamond \xB7 Christian Thalmann\nCinzel \xB7 Natanael Gama\n\n<b>Modelos y texturas</b>
    (CC0, Poly Haven)\nGothic Statue  \xB7  Poly Haven (Benny Weimer)\nMarble Bust
    01  \xB7  Poly Haven (Rico Cilliers)\nHorse Statue 01  \xB7  Poly Haven (Rico
    Cilliers)\nLion Head  \xB7  Poly Haven (Tina)\nFancy Picture Frame 01  \xB7 
    Poly Haven (Rob Tuytel, Rico Cilliers)\nFancy Picture Frame 02  \xB7  Poly Haven
    (Rob Tuytel, Rico Cilliers)\nOrnate Mirror 01  \xB7  Poly Haven (James Ray Cock)\nWooden
    Candlestick  \xB7  Poly Haven (Josh Dean)\nChandelier 01  \xB7  Poly Haven (Kirill
    Sannikov)\nPainted Wooden Bench  \xB7  Poly Haven (Kirill Sannikov)\nLarge Castle
    Door  \xB7  Poly Haven (Tina)\nAntique Ceramic Vase 01  \xB7  Poly Haven (James
    Ray Cock)\nGothic Cabinet 01  \xB7  Poly Haven (Kirill Sannikov)\nVintage Grandfather
    Clock 01  \xB7  Poly Haven (Yann Kervran, James Ray Cock)\nArm Chair 01  \xB7 
    Poly Haven (Kirill Sannikov)\nMarble Tiles  \xB7  Poly Haven (Charlotte Baglioni)\nPlastered
    Wall 04  \xB7  Poly Haven (Rob Tuytel)\nVelour Velvet  \xB7  Poly Haven (colormass,
    Rico Cilliers)\n\n<b>Sonido</b>\nS\xEDntesis procedural en tiempo real\n\n<i>Gracias
    por mirar.</i>"
